From 7405d0c92a3e936ba7aebb943698996a1e1a5b42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Antti Laakso <antti.laakso@linux.intel.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:29:32 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/45] media: ipu6: Prepare mmu driver for hw variation

We are about to add support for ipu7 mmu. Split ipu6 mmu
hardware specific and common code to separate files.

Signed-off-by: Antti Laakso <antti.laakso@linux.intel.com>
Signed-off-by: Sakari Ailus <sakari.ailus@linux.intel.com>
